{"a":[5,5],"h":"<p>5.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"71\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 71.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 41.3 41.3 48.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 48.0 54.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> tenzilî - nasb ile de ref'ile de okunur. Ya'ni peyderpey indirdiği vahyi - ile<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"134\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 134.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 25.6 32.3 32.3 44.3 44.3 51.8 59.3 75.0 75.0 82.6 89.3 89.3 96.8 103.6 103.6 111.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 96.8 117.8\" y=\"20.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o azîz rahîmin - bütün ızzet ve kuvvet, galebe ve nusrat kendisinin olan ve ızzetini tanıyan mü'minlere ni'met ve rahmetine nihayet olmıyan Allah zül'celâlin. Burada esmai husnâdan bilhassa bu iki ismi celîlin zikri «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"215\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 215.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 14.3 14.3 21.0 32.3 32.3 40.6 57.7 57.7 64.6 71.3 87.0 87.0 97.6 104.3 104.3 111.0 111.0 120.0 141.0 141.0 147.7 147.7 147.7 154.6 162.0 177.7 194.3 201.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"21.0 40.6 64.6 71.3 87.0 97.6 120.0 124.6 177.7 194.3 201.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » mazmuniyle «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"238\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 238.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 20.3 20.3 29.3 36.8 43.6 50.3 50.3 57.0 57.0 73.6 73.6 80.3 89.3 89.3 101.3 118.6 123.0 130.6 130.6 146.3 157.6 164.3 171.0 171.0 189.0 189.0 197.3 213.0 213.0 